        dct:description "The growth GIF is 16 frames at 640x480 and ends on the MHNT egg (CV similarity 84.7 against that photograph). The generative panel is a labyrinth at about 1.18 mm, while the egg texture measures 0.66 mm. Those are different patterns. Pass 1 does not treat the terminal frame as proof that the PDE drew the pores." ;
